Cache rules are narrowed to this wiki and instance (~/.cache/wiki-sources/<wiki>/<key>/); a broader rule already in settings.json, e.g. Read(~/.cache/wiki-sources/**), covers them too.

proton-files (access: tools) names no tools, so it adds no tool rules here (only its cache rules, if any). Allow the read tools this machine supplies for it yourself (this wiki's settings or your user settings; see its Caveats). How read-only is kept is in its Caveats, not in these settings.
